sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EnergyTransferStarted

    loop Every configured sampled Meter Values interval, until three MeterValues have been sent
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = MeterValuePeriodic, eventType = Updated, timestamp, sampledValue.context = Sample.Periodic)
        Note right of CS: Intervals between the timestamps equal the configured sampled Meter Values interval
        CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System ends the testcase after three MeterValues
